    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "Principle 14. My future dream (1)"
    },
    {
      "type": "sentences",
      "items": [
        {
          "n": "172",
          "text": "There are many jobs in the world."
        },
        {
          "n": "173",
          "text": "It is very hard to choose only one."
        },
        {
          "n": "174",
          "text": "I have changed my mind many times about what to be."
        },
        {
          "n": "175",
          "text": "Right now my dream is to be a teacher."
        },
        {
          "n": "176",
          "text": "I want to be a teacher for many reasons."
        },
        {
          "n": "177",
          "text": "First, my school teacher sets good examples."
        },
        {
          "n": "178",
          "text": "She loves children and loves teaching us."
        },
        {
          "n": "179",
          "text": "When I need help from her, she always helps me."
        },
        {
          "n": "180",
          "text": "Second, my teacher knows a lot."
        },
        {
          "n": "181",
          "text": "I want to be a good teacher like her."
        },
        {
          "n": "182",
          "text": "In order to be a good teacher, my parents tell me that I need to"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "study hard."
    },
    {
      "type": "sentences",
      "items": [
        {
          "n": "183",
          "text": "They also tell me I need to love children."
        },
        {
          "n": "184",
          "text": "I think teaching children is fun, and rewarding."
        },
        {
          "n": "185",
          "text": "I must learn patience to be a good teacher."
        }
      ]
    },
